{"articleNo":"861","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=861&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[국제교류센터] 2009 단기 일본어 국제교류도우미 모집(~8/3)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.07.23","hit":"18495","attachments":[{"name":"국제교류도우미 지원 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=861&attachNo=70936"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 활동 목적 : 2009학년도 하계방학기간 중 우리 대학을 방문하여 한국어 및 한국문화를 체험하고자 하는 해외자매결연대학 학생들과의 1:1 교류를 통해 양 국의 학생들이 서로의 언어 및 문화를 이해하고&nbsp;교류할 수 있도록&nbsp;하기 위함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#20b2aa\">2. 활동 기간 : 2009. 8. 16(일) ~ 8. 22(토)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#20b2aa\">3.&nbsp;접수 기간 : 2009. 7. 27(월) ~ 8. 3(월)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#20b2aa\">4. 모집 인원 : 5명</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 활동 내용 : 1) 프로그램 진행 보조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 학생 인솔</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 한국문화체험 참가 19-20일 (1박 2일)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 정규 프로그램 외 국제교류도우미들과의 자유 교류시간 진행</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 지원&nbsp;자격 : 1) 일본어 공인어학성적 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 일본어 회화능력 우수자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 책임감 있고 외국인에 대한 배려 및 봉사정신이 투철한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">7. 제출 서류 : 1) 국제교류도우미 신청서 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 공인 어학시험 성적표 사본 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">8.&nbsp;접수 &nbsp;: 이메일 <a href=\"mailto:hjkim@kumoh.ac.kr\">hjkim@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">9. 합격자&nbsp;및 오리엔테이션 일정&nbsp;: 개별통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (필요시 소정의 인터뷰 일정이 추가 될 수 있음)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">10. 혜텍 : 1) 봉사활동 30시간 인정 확인서 수여&nbsp;(봉사활동 1학점 인정 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 한국문화체험 프로그램 경비 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 활동기간 식권 제공</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 국제교류센터(7933)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
